# Rendered output
out/
# Quilts are never committed -- one 16" landscape quilt is 25-40 MB and they
# regenerate from pov-scenes/ plus the scripts.  These two patterns have no
# slash, so git applies them at every depth: a quilt is ignored wherever it is
# written, not just at the repo root.  Overriding that needs an explicit
# negation, which is deliberate.
*_qs[0-9]*x[0-9]*a*.png
*_qs[0-9]*x[0-9]*a*.mp4
renders/quilts/
renders/stills/
pov-scenes/**/*.png

# OS
.DS_Store

# Cruft
*.o

